 "summary": "A full player the app drives: generated cover, title, artist, a seek bar that follows the app and survives a drag, and transport controls. Stacked on a phone, side by side in landscape, compact as a 4x2 and a 2x2 widget.",
 "prompt": "Build a music player screen: album art, title, artist, a seek bar, play pause, next, previous, shuffle and repeat. It must work on a phone in both orientations and as a home screen widget.",
