 "teaches": [
  "The seek bar shows the app's position except while a finger is down; the release writes the position and sends it",
  "One flow for phone and landscape, its boxes sized from the window; a widget gets its own small tree, shown by visibility",
  "Each copy of the controls has its own action names, as the Java parser needs",
  "Choose the layout by what it needs, not by window ratio alone: the stack needs 356 dp of height for a 96 dp cover and the controls, side by side needs 248, and below those the compact tree takes over"
 ],
