 "check": {
  "describe": "360x640 and taller: square cover, title and artist left with the equalizer right, the seek bar at 1:23 / -2:22, shuffle, previous, a large pause, next, repeat, all centred as one group. Landscape from 460 wide: cover left, the rest right, all five controls; 352 to 460 wide and 248 tall: a smaller cover and three controls. Squarish or under 248 tall, such as 300x300, 320x240 and 320x160: cover beside title, a slim seek bar, three controls. 160x160: a cover strip, title, three controls. Long titles end in an ellipsis. dur 0: an empty track and --:--.",
